        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions STR6SMTSS4BSS, Satin Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull with Round Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sutter Rectangular  Stainless Steel  Door Pull is a great contemporary pull for both commercial and residential doors. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull with Round Mounts is made in the U.S.A. It has a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/sutter-rectangular-brass-door-pull-first-impressions-str5smtsbr\"><b>Brass Sutter Rectangular Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/sutter-rectangular-aluminum-door-pull-first-impressions-str4smtss4\"><b>Aluminum Sutter Rectangular Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sutter Series 6 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-STR06-specifications.pdf?v=1704262257\"><b>First Impressions STR6SMTSS4BSS Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>STR6012SMTSS4BSS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.88\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR6024SMTSS4BSS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.88\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR6036SMTSS4BSS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.88\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sutter Rectangular Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "The Sutter Rectangular  Stainless Steel  Door Pull is a great contemporary pull for both commercial and residential doors. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull with Round Mounts is made in the U.S.A. It has a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n",
